3. **Endurance** (1GG) - Flash, reach, can put target card from graveyard on bottom of library. Good defensive creature.\n\
4. **Halo Forager** (1UB) - 3/1 flyer, can cast instant/sorcery from opponent's graveyard.\n\
5. **Overlord of the Balemurk** (2UB) - 3/2 flyer, can make opponent discard.\n\
6. **Wistfulness** (3U) - 3/3, draws a card when dies.\n\
7. **Street Wraith, Subtlety, Deceit, Generous Ent, Formidable Speaker** - duplicates of what I already have.\n\
\n\
