\n\
Shardless Agent (2U) is good - cascade into a 2 CMC or less spell. Could hit something useful.\n\
\n\
Endurance (1GG) is good defensive creature with flash, but requires double green.\n\
\n\
Halo Forager (1UB) requires black mana which I don't have great access to yet.\n\
\n\
Overlord of the Balemurk (2UB) also requires black.\n\
\n\
Curator of Mysteries (2UU) requires double blue, similar to Subtlety.\n\
\n\
Given my mana (UG lands), Shardless Agent (2U) seems best - single blue requirement, cascade value. I'll take Shardless Agent.\n\
\n\
